{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-idle-adjust-year-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.70, step 7f. `scale-county-idle-adjust-year`: `scale-county-idle-adjust-month` under `<aggregateBy key=\"Year\"/>`, output Year. MOVESOutput is 1,016 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is off-network idle's idle adjustments under PreAggYEAR.sql on top of PreAggMONTH.sql, both BEFORE AdjustTotalIdleFraction.sql runs: idleDayAdjust collapsed to the whole week (`sum(idleDayAdjust x noOfRealDays/7)`, 1.02 and 0.8), idleMonthAdjust to the UNWEIGHTED mean of the rows the input merge left at the RunSpec's months (1.01 for the passenger car, April's 1.08 and August's 0.94; none for the truck), and AdjustTotalIdleFraction.sql's grouping override crossed with month 0 and day 0. Measured against the execution database: idleMonthAdjust and idleDayAdjust exact, and its five totalIdleFraction rows the grouping times both (PLAN.md §7.3.70).\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1 and `db_aggregationmonth` is the RunSpec's months, read from its XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py`. `n_outputRate` is bound to 1016, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step",
      "idle-adjustment",
      "year-aggregation"
    ]
  },
